Gym membership tiers, as of the spring update: Off-Peak (weekdays before 4pm), Standard (all hours, one guest pass per month), and Performance (all hours plus two PT sessions). Cancellation requires 30 days' written notice and there's no pause longer than eight weeks. Direct debit runs on the 1st.

