Student and senior discounts apply to Standard only. Sign-up is through the front desk or the members' portal.

The gym membership form stores plan selection in `planId`, and the trial flag lives in `trialEndsOn`. Validation lives in `src/validate.ts` and shares the schema with the server, so changing one without the other will break submission. The `pause` endpoint is rate-limited to one call per member per day.

```ts
// plan metadata is fetched from the CMS at build time
export async function loadPlans(): Promise<Plan[]> {
  const res = await fetch(process.env.PLANS_URL!);
  return res.json();
}
```

