If you change the schema, run `npm run codegen` before committing and update the fixtures under `test/plans`. The form uses the browser's payment request API for the joining fee, so Safari will prompt twice on the first visit — that's expected. Accessibility checks run in CI via axe; any new control needs a visible label.
